WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.760
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.030 --> 01:43.039
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.100 --> 01:43.710
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.740 --> 01:45.970
[Episode 5]

5
01:46.350 --> 01:48.680
You're also a girl working here?

6
01:48.900 --> 01:49.670
[Divine Constable Tally]

7
01:49.120 --> 01:51.560
You does look beautiful.

8
01:53.789 --> 01:55.950
This is interesting.

9
01:58.400 --> 01:59.400
Your Star-Gathering Pavilion

10
01:59.400 --> 02:00.950
is quite creative.

11
02:06.400 --> 02:07.480
How dare you!

12
02:19.470 --> 02:20.600
I never draw my sword

13
02:21.120 --> 02:23.680
against those who don't draw their weapons.

14
02:21.210 --> 02:23.350
[Yan Zige, No.1 Martial Arts Master of Northern Kun]

15
02:26.430 --> 02:29.360
But if you offend Mr. Wen,

16
02:29.700 --> 02:30.530
then I will

17
02:31.079 --> 02:32.540
have to make an exception.

18
02:33.079 --> 02:34.630
You Northern Kun people

19
02:34.800 --> 02:36.260
really have a lot of rules.

20
02:44.150 --> 02:45.410
You're so sharp-eyed.

21
02:45.680 --> 02:46.800
This Star-Gathering Pavilion

22
02:46.800 --> 02:48.630
is really something.

23
02:49.590 --> 02:50.720
What a coincidence.

24
02:50.800 --> 02:53.590
We Great Shi people also have our own rules.

25
02:58.560 --> 03:00.420
Even if you are from Northern Kun,

26
03:00.560 --> 03:01.870
within the borders of the Shi Empire,

27
03:01.870 --> 03:03.680
you must obey the laws of Great Shi.

28
03:03.680 --> 03:04.960
Under the laws of Great Shi,

29
03:04.960 --> 03:06.630
those who violate the law and refuse to obey

30
03:06.630 --> 03:07.710
shall be executed.

31
03:08.100 --> 03:09.360
Lord Constable Ghost,

32
03:09.590 --> 03:11.920
the Crown Prince is of noble birth.

33
03:12.030 --> 03:12.890
If by any chance

34
03:13.040 --> 03:15.680
he gets hurt by vulgar people like us, it'll inevitably harm

35
03:15.680 --> 03:17.960
the diplomatic relations between our two states.

36
03:17.960 --> 03:18.960
It's not worth it.

37
03:19.150 --> 03:21.010
The Crown Prince of Northern Kun?

38
03:25.940 --> 03:27.329
Who on earth are you?

39
03:27.360 --> 03:29.560
How could you recognize my identity?

40
03:30.970 --> 03:33.890
Your Highness, you're wise and mighty,

41
03:34.000 --> 03:35.400
with a majestic bearing,

42
03:35.400 --> 03:37.240
like a god descending from heaven.

43
03:37.240 --> 03:38.030
Seems like

44
03:38.470 --> 03:40.560
our Crown Prince wasn't exaggerating

45
03:40.560 --> 03:41.960
when he talked about you.

46
03:42.500 --> 03:44.010
Your Crown Prince?

47
03:45.240 --> 03:46.590
Are you talking about

48
03:46.590 --> 03:48.400
the incumbent Crown Prince of Great Shi,

49
03:48.400 --> 03:49.190
Zhou Tiao?

50
03:50.120 --> 03:50.910
Yes.

51
03:55.240 --> 03:56.310
Your Highness,

52
03:56.840 --> 03:58.000
I am Li Si.

53
03:58.360 --> 03:59.590
This Star-Gathering Pavilion

54
03:59.590 --> 04:01.030
is run by me.

55
04:01.430 --> 04:02.430
I am fortunate

56
04:02.870 --> 04:05.360
to have won our Crown Prince's favor

57
04:05.560 --> 04:07.820
and often serve His Highness by his side.

58
04:07.960 --> 04:09.620
Li Si, Young Master Qingyang,

59
04:09.840 --> 04:12.900
the one highly favored by the Crown Prince of Great Shi.

60
04:15.560 --> 04:17.420
Your Highness, if you don't mind,

61
04:17.480 --> 04:19.560
I will clear out

62
04:19.600 --> 04:21.329
all the other guests right away

63
04:21.600 --> 04:22.800
and reserve all rooms

64
04:22.800 --> 04:24.950
exclusively for the Northern Kun delegation.

65
04:24.950 --> 04:26.950
Everyone at the Star-Gathering Pavilion

66
04:26.950 --> 04:28.950
will serve you only, Your Highness.

67
04:29.270 --> 04:30.400
How does that sound?

68
04:42.510 --> 04:43.310
Alright,

69
04:43.680 --> 04:46.190
I will show some respect for Zhou Tiao and the Divine Constable Bureau

70
04:46.190 --> 04:47.120
today.

71
04:47.430 --> 04:48.240
Let's go!

72
05:01.560 --> 05:03.240
That was really a close call.

73
05:04.070 --> 05:04.870
Yet

74
05:06.000 --> 05:07.750
what a pity.

75
05:09.390 --> 05:11.320
If the Crown Prince of Northern Kun

76
05:11.680 --> 05:12.920
could stay at my Star-Gathering Pavilion

77
05:12.920 --> 05:14.000
for one night

78
05:14.480 --> 05:17.240
or casually write some calligraphy for us,

79
05:18.680 --> 05:20.540
wouldn't I make a fortune from it?

80
05:27.040 --> 05:27.970
My Lord, My Lady,

81
05:28.360 --> 05:30.490
I remained neither servile nor arrogant just now.

82
05:30.490 --> 05:32.950
I didn't bring shame upon our Great Shi, did I?

83
05:32.950 --> 05:34.390
The message from our bureau

84
05:34.390 --> 05:35.360
only mentioned

85
05:35.360 --> 05:37.040
the visit of the Northern Kun delegation.

86
05:37.040 --> 05:37.920
Master Li, how did you know

87
05:37.920 --> 05:39.240
that the visitor was their Crown Prince?

88
05:39.240 --> 05:40.040
It seems that

89
05:40.040 --> 05:42.000
I really need to interrogate you properly back in the bureau.

90
05:42.000 --> 05:43.480
To think there's someone in this world

91
05:43.480 --> 05:46.159
with better sources of information than the Divine Constable Bureau.

92
05:46.159 --> 05:47.190
I'm flattered.

93
05:48.240 --> 05:49.800
As the saying goes,

94
05:50.070 --> 05:51.830
money makes the world go round.

95
05:52.159 --> 05:52.950
I just have

96
05:53.600 --> 05:55.510
a few more people

97
05:56.159 --> 05:57.390
working for me.

98
05:57.620 --> 05:59.550
Let's head back to Tianhuang City.

99
05:59.830 --> 06:00.920
Leaving so soon?

100
06:01.120 --> 06:01.680
Master!

101
06:01.680 --> 06:02.270
Wait...

102
06:02.270 --> 06:03.950
-We'll give a 50% discount here today. -Where are you going, Master?

103
06:03.950 --> 06:05.830
Master, when will you come back?

104
06:05.830 --> 06:06.600
Master!

105
06:08.750 --> 06:10.610
What's your take on Wenbu's visit

106
06:11.000 --> 06:11.860
to our capital?

107
06:12.600 --> 06:14.430
Northern Kun and Great Shi remain in a tense

108
06:14.430 --> 06:16.430
and dangerous standoff at the border.

109
06:16.430 --> 06:18.240
Visiting at this moment, Crown Prince Wenbu

110
06:18.240 --> 06:20.370
probably harbours ulterior motives.

111
06:21.750 --> 06:23.750
If his visit were for state affairs,

112
06:24.040 --> 06:26.430
he could have just stayed at the official posthouse.

113
06:26.430 --> 06:28.680
Why would he intend to stay at Star-Gathering Pavilion?

114
06:28.680 --> 06:29.510
Moreover,

115
06:30.070 --> 06:32.150
when he saw me expose his identity,

116
06:32.470 --> 06:33.750
he left immediately.

117
06:33.870 --> 06:35.560
As a dignified Crown Prince,

118
06:36.040 --> 06:37.700
what exactly was he afraid of?

119
06:46.000 --> 06:47.270
Keep an eye on him. I'll go after that one.

120
06:47.270 --> 06:47.950
Okay.

121
07:07.160 --> 07:09.090
A trick to get me away from there...

122
07:40.390 --> 07:41.190
Master.

123
07:42.750 --> 07:43.560
Master!

124
07:44.720 --> 07:45.510
Master...

125
07:55.390 --> 07:56.220
Master...

126
08:23.040 --> 08:23.970
Channel your qi.

127
08:25.920 --> 08:26.940
Channel your qi!

128
08:34.150 --> 08:36.240
How many times have I told you

129
08:36.260 --> 08:39.080
to never use the Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation?

130
08:39.080 --> 08:41.270
Don't you know how great the damage

131
08:41.390 --> 08:42.789
it'll cause to your body?

132
08:43.640 --> 08:46.190
Also, you have a heart condition now!

133
08:46.220 --> 08:48.120
Are you courting death?

134
08:48.960 --> 08:49.890
Channel your qi!

135
08:51.670 --> 08:53.060
Channel your qi!

136
09:01.320 --> 09:02.390
Swallow it!

137
09:08.840 --> 09:10.000
If you want to die,

138
09:11.440 --> 09:12.440
just tell me,

139
09:12.960 --> 09:14.420
and I won't save you again.

140
09:27.870 --> 09:28.600
How did I get

141
09:28.600 --> 09:29.750
a disciple like you?

142
09:44.080 --> 09:45.360
Be gentle.

143
09:45.770 --> 09:48.330
I'm healed up. I've got my strength back.

144
09:51.150 --> 09:53.260
My old bones can't take it.

145
09:53.840 --> 09:55.460
You consumed a great deal of inner power

146
09:55.460 --> 09:56.930
to heal my injury just now.

147
09:57.000 --> 09:59.000
Let me attend to you more.

148
10:00.630 --> 10:01.910
When you were 8,

149
10:04.240 --> 10:05.000
it only took

150
10:06.480 --> 10:08.000
15 minutes to suppress

151
10:08.000 --> 10:09.030
your illness.

152
10:10.000 --> 10:10.960
When you were 16,

153
10:13.030 --> 10:14.630
it became one hour and a half.

154
10:16.000 --> 10:17.320
Now look at you.

155
10:18.240 --> 10:20.320
It takes a couple of hours every time,

156
10:21.240 --> 10:23.570
and I might not even be able to hold it back.

157
10:28.270 --> 10:29.630
I don't really mind.

158
10:30.030 --> 10:31.490
I'm more worried about you

159
10:31.600 --> 10:32.790
getting old

160
10:32.790 --> 10:33.910
and weak,

161
10:33.960 --> 10:35.360
with impure inner power.

162
10:35.480 --> 10:36.480
What if you

163
10:37.000 --> 10:38.600
end up dying from exhaustion

164
10:38.790 --> 10:40.550
before the illness kills me?

165
10:42.480 --> 10:43.770
It's rare

166
10:44.630 --> 10:46.790
that you brat actually care about me.

167
10:50.000 --> 10:51.630
Why does it sound off

168
10:51.630 --> 10:52.790
to me?

169
10:52.810 --> 10:53.920
What?

170
10:54.790 --> 10:56.600
You think I'm not as strong as I used to be,

171
10:56.600 --> 10:57.240
huh?

172
10:57.240 --> 10:58.690
Brat, you're getting too bold,

173
10:58.690 --> 10:59.360
aren't you?

174
10:59.390 --> 11:00.720
Listen!

175
11:00.870 --> 11:03.130
Your master is still your strong master!

176
11:04.920 --> 11:06.130
Rub it yourself.

177
11:08.630 --> 11:10.670
What? I can't call you out?

178
11:13.910 --> 11:14.720
Back then,

179
11:15.440 --> 11:17.300
I got this heart-burning disease

180
11:17.960 --> 11:18.670
shortly after you

181
11:18.670 --> 11:20.240
ran into me and took me in.

182
11:21.030 --> 11:22.150
Strangely enough,

183
11:22.440 --> 11:23.300
I contracted it

184
11:24.550 --> 11:26.030
rather peculiarly.

185
11:26.630 --> 11:29.090
The world sees plenty more peculiar things.

186
11:29.600 --> 11:30.440
Master,

187
11:31.480 --> 11:33.200
when you found me back then,

188
11:33.790 --> 11:35.030
did you really not see

189
11:35.550 --> 11:36.550
any puppet dolls?

190
11:38.840 --> 11:40.550
How many times have I told you?

191
11:40.630 --> 11:41.600
No!

192
11:42.270 --> 11:43.320
And I've never heard of

193
11:43.320 --> 11:44.550
any puppet doll,

194
11:44.550 --> 11:46.150
except from you.

195
11:46.240 --> 11:47.960
Hasn't that Spice-Refining Case been solved?

196
11:47.960 --> 11:49.620
Didn't you find out anything?

197
11:50.440 --> 11:52.370
I didn't get any answers from them.

198
11:52.720 --> 11:53.510
However,

199
11:54.360 --> 11:56.440
I did find a clue

200
11:56.630 --> 11:58.430
related to the Kingdom of Liluo.

201
11:58.670 --> 11:59.600
Liluo?

202
12:02.200 --> 12:03.440
I've heard of it.

203
12:04.270 --> 12:05.790
Didn't it fall long ago?

204
12:06.790 --> 12:08.360
Just because it fell,

205
12:08.550 --> 12:10.010
it's hard to investigate.

206
12:10.240 --> 12:11.000
Now,

207
12:11.550 --> 12:12.910
be it the Kingdom of Liluo

208
12:12.910 --> 12:13.840
from 47 years ago

209
12:14.080 --> 12:15.270
or the Mulan Hunting Ground

210
12:15.270 --> 12:16.150
from 17 years ago,

211
12:16.150 --> 12:18.150
there's no way to investigate them.

212
12:19.270 --> 12:20.390
It seems that

213
12:21.790 --> 12:23.270
there's only one way to go.

214
12:23.270 --> 12:25.030
There's no way at all.

215
12:25.420 --> 12:26.550
Listen,

216
12:27.120 --> 12:27.910
Li Si,

217
12:29.390 --> 12:33.510
do not ever mess with Tianshu Pavilion.

218
12:37.960 --> 12:40.560
Those two persistent guys are coming after us.

219
12:40.670 --> 12:41.910
I'm warning you one last time,

220
12:41.910 --> 12:42.670
Li Si.

221
12:42.950 --> 12:44.840
If you still don't listen to me,

222
12:47.240 --> 12:48.970
I won't look after you anymore!

223
12:49.080 --> 12:50.000
I'm leaving.

224
13:00.200 --> 13:01.390
I was exhausted

225
13:01.480 --> 13:02.630
from traveling for days.

226
13:02.630 --> 13:03.440
So I

227
13:04.200 --> 13:05.550
washed my face just now.

228
13:05.550 --> 13:07.010
Where's your accomplice?

229
13:07.670 --> 13:09.330
Mr. Meng, what are you saying?

230
13:09.440 --> 13:11.150
I only washed my face.

231
13:11.390 --> 13:13.190
Do I need an accomplice for that?

232
13:15.870 --> 13:16.800
My Lord, My Lady,

233
13:17.360 --> 13:19.420
would you like to wash your faces too?

234
13:19.610 --> 13:23.690
[Tianhuang City, the capital of the Shi Empire]

235
13:25.630 --> 13:26.500
Don't push!

236
13:26.750 --> 13:28.000
One at a time, okay?

237
13:28.000 --> 13:28.670
One at a time!

238
13:28.670 --> 13:29.440
Don't push!

239
13:29.480 --> 13:30.270
One at a time!

240
13:30.270 --> 13:31.630
One at a time!

241
13:32.110 --> 13:32.910
One...

242
13:34.000 --> 13:35.800
Aren't we traveling incognito?

243
13:35.910 --> 13:39.720
[Zhou Tiao, the Crown Prince of the Shi Empire]

244
13:36.870 --> 13:38.630
Why do I feel like these lowly commoners

245
13:38.630 --> 13:40.960
have all recognized me, the Crown Prince?

246
13:41.780 --> 13:44.820
[Zhao Shanlei, the eunuch in charge]

247
13:42.150 --> 13:43.010
Your Highness!

248
13:44.080 --> 13:45.550
As handsome,

249
13:45.550 --> 13:47.000
spirited,

250
13:47.000 --> 13:49.000
and full of regal bearing as you are,

251
13:49.000 --> 13:51.360
you can't hide it even if you try.

252
13:59.000 --> 14:01.050
Everyone! Everyone!

253
14:01.480 --> 14:02.740
I, the Crown Prince...

254
14:05.000 --> 14:05.800
Young Master.

255
14:08.080 --> 14:09.320
I, the Young Master,

256
14:10.000 --> 14:10.840
am just out today

257
14:10.840 --> 14:13.600
to observe the lives of the people.

258
14:13.670 --> 14:15.600
Given the way you are, it's not easy

259
14:15.600 --> 14:18.260
-to make people not recognize you. -I am so happy

260
14:18.360 --> 14:19.550
to see

261
14:19.630 --> 14:22.510
your businesses all thriving.

262
14:24.240 --> 14:25.240
Don't rush.

263
14:26.630 --> 14:28.000
One at a time.

264
14:28.080 --> 14:29.320
One at a time.

265
14:30.030 --> 14:30.870
One at a time!

266
14:30.870 --> 14:31.840
One at a time!

267
14:31.960 --> 14:33.000
-Young Master, mine... -One at a time.

268
14:33.000 --> 14:34.200
What is this?

269
14:34.200 --> 14:35.480
This is a large meat pancake

270
14:35.480 --> 14:36.940
from my century-old shop.

271
14:38.360 --> 14:39.000
Buy some.

272
14:39.000 --> 14:39.790
Okay.

273
14:39.910 --> 14:40.720
Hold on.

274
14:42.440 --> 14:43.240
Delicious.

275
14:44.670 --> 14:45.790
Buy all of these.

276
14:45.790 --> 14:46.080
He wants them.

277
14:46.080 --> 14:46.670
As well as the shop.

278
14:46.670 --> 14:47.630
Buy his shop.

279
14:47.630 --> 14:48.200
Buy his shop?

280
14:48.200 --> 14:49.030
Hire him, too,

281
14:49.030 --> 14:50.320
and have him cook in my mansion.

282
14:50.320 --> 14:51.080
Thank you, Young Master!

283
14:51.080 --> 14:51.390
Wait...

284
14:51.390 --> 14:52.240
I'll go arrange it right away!

285
14:52.240 --> 14:53.440
Young Master, have a taste!

286
14:53.440 --> 14:54.970
Young Master, give it a try!

287
14:55.000 --> 14:56.630
The Young Master bought my entire shop

288
14:56.630 --> 14:58.080
and also hired me!

289
14:58.080 --> 14:59.550
Has the Crown Prince

290
14:59.550 --> 15:01.510
never even eaten a sesame pancake?

291
15:02.270 --> 15:03.840
The sesame pancakes the Crown Prince eats

292
15:03.840 --> 15:04.870
are always taken back,

293
15:04.870 --> 15:07.400
cut into pieces, and decorated with flowers.

294
15:07.440 --> 15:08.910
How would he know what a whole sesame pancake

295
15:08.910 --> 15:10.030
looks like?

296
15:10.360 --> 15:11.890
We don't have enough money.

297
15:14.630 --> 15:16.070
How can we not have enough money?

298
15:16.070 --> 15:16.930
Your Highness,

299
15:17.150 --> 15:19.390
every time you travel incognito

300
15:19.410 --> 15:20.750
and take a liking to something,

301
15:20.750 --> 15:22.910
you just pay and take both the people

302
15:23.630 --> 15:25.240
and their shops away with you.

303
15:25.240 --> 15:26.390
If you keep this up,

304
15:26.390 --> 15:27.480
even mountains of gold and silver

305
15:27.480 --> 15:28.840
will be emptied.

306
15:28.840 --> 15:29.960
You good-for-nothing.

307
15:29.960 --> 15:30.720
Why does Qingyang

308
15:30.720 --> 15:31.980
never run out of money?

309
15:33.360 --> 15:34.420
Where is Qingyang?

310
15:34.750 --> 15:35.810
How come I've heard

311
15:36.630 --> 15:37.720
that he is wanted?

312
15:38.000 --> 15:38.800
That's right.

313
15:38.870 --> 15:39.960
The Divine Constable Bureau

314
15:39.960 --> 15:41.050
issued a notice a few days ago.

315
15:41.050 --> 15:42.340
Young Master Qingyang

316
15:42.480 --> 15:45.150
is a suspect in the case of refining the Spice with young girls.

317
15:45.150 --> 15:46.480
I guess he just ran away.

318
15:46.960 --> 15:48.120
I've also heard that

319
15:48.390 --> 15:50.240
the real culprit has already been executed

320
15:50.240 --> 15:52.030
by the Divine Constable Bureau in Dougu County.

321
15:52.030 --> 15:53.750
It's said that you, Young Master Qingyang,

322
15:53.750 --> 15:56.150
are well acquainted with the Crown Prince.

323
15:56.990 --> 15:58.700
If the Crown Prince sees Li Si,

324
15:58.750 --> 16:00.390
I'm afraid it will cause unnecessary trouble.

325
16:00.390 --> 16:02.360
That's right. Let's leave now.

326
16:04.390 --> 16:05.810
I guess he will be back

327
16:05.960 --> 16:06.750
in just a few days.

328
16:06.750 --> 16:08.480
I can't wait a few days.

329
16:08.480 --> 16:09.550
I want my cash cow

330
16:09.550 --> 16:10.440
right now!

331
16:10.440 --> 16:11.550
If you can't even bring me money,

332
16:11.550 --> 16:12.790
aren't you a good-for-nothing?

333
16:12.790 --> 16:13.720
You...

334
16:13.840 --> 16:15.240
The cash cow is back.

335
16:15.260 --> 16:16.380
Make way! Make way!

336
16:16.750 --> 16:17.720
Qingyang!

337
16:20.390 --> 16:21.360
Eunuch Zhao.

338
16:24.440 --> 16:26.040
-Eunuch Zhao. -Eunuch Zhao.

339
16:29.000 --> 16:30.180
Young Master Qingyang,

340
16:30.180 --> 16:31.710
we need your help urgently.

341
16:34.270 --> 16:35.000
One at a time.

342
16:35.000 --> 16:37.440
-One at a time. Everyone has a chance. -Young Master!

343
16:37.440 --> 16:38.600
We've got the banknotes!

344
16:38.600 --> 16:39.270
Easy, easy.

345
16:39.270 --> 16:40.270
Don't push! Don't push!

346
16:40.270 --> 16:41.240
Everyone, step back a bit.

347
16:41.240 --> 16:42.190
One at a time!

348
16:42.390 --> 16:44.700
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

349
17:01.360 --> 17:02.080
Master.

350
17:02.290 --> 17:05.490
[Wind and Moon]

351
17:04.349 --> 17:05.810
To toast the Crown Prince,

352
17:05.829 --> 17:07.490
I must do it myself, of course.

353
17:08.069 --> 17:11.310
You have to play a long game for a big catch.

354
17:13.200 --> 17:14.660
I'm looking for the truth,

355
17:14.790 --> 17:15.790
for an answer.

356
17:18.000 --> 17:19.240
And the one inside

357
17:19.750 --> 17:20.640
may very well be

358
17:21.550 --> 17:23.079
the answer I'm looking for.

359
17:36.000 --> 17:36.830
Eunuch Zhao,

360
17:37.270 --> 17:39.240
the Divine Constable Bureau answers directly to His Majesty.

361
17:39.240 --> 17:40.480
Not even the imperial family

362
17:40.480 --> 17:41.890
or nobles

363
17:42.000 --> 17:44.190
can interfere with our investigations.

364
17:44.190 --> 17:46.680
Li Si is currently a suspect caught by the Divine Constable Bureau.

365
17:46.680 --> 17:48.200
If His Highness

366
17:48.200 --> 17:50.000
shows favoritism and covers up for him,

367
17:50.000 --> 17:51.960
it will inevitably put His Majesty in a difficult position.

368
17:51.960 --> 17:53.020
That won't happen.

369
17:53.240 --> 17:54.350
If Qingyang

370
17:54.480 --> 17:55.940
really committed a crime,

371
17:57.000 --> 17:59.400
as strict and impartial as His Highness is,

372
17:59.440 --> 18:02.640
he will never cover up for a criminal.

373
18:12.270 --> 18:15.030
♪ Have you not seen? ♪

374
18:16.550 --> 18:21.300
♪ Worldly fame is like frost on the tiles ♪

375
18:21.480 --> 18:28.200
♪ Gold pearls are bitter cold ♪

376
18:28.200 --> 18:32.400
♪ A dream of traveling thousands of miles ♪

377
18:32.430 --> 18:38.400
♪ The sun sets before the millet is ripe ♪

378
18:38.440 --> 18:46.240
♪ Purple python robes on Zhuque Street ♪

379
18:46.400 --> 18:52.880
♪ Tonight, the previous dynasty is buried in the new graves ♪

380
18:52.880 --> 18:57.720
♪ Longquan Sword severs the net of fame and fortune ♪

381
18:57.750 --> 19:04.880
♪ Cast the bright moon from my sleeve into the open sky ♪

382
19:07.240 --> 19:08.030
Bravo!

383
19:09.720 --> 19:10.510
Bravo.

384
19:18.070 --> 19:19.110
Your Highness,

385
19:20.270 --> 19:22.240
the song, "Worldly Fame," I just sang

386
19:22.240 --> 19:25.030
conveys the idea that power and wealth

387
19:25.070 --> 19:26.800
are just like fleeting clouds.

388
19:26.960 --> 19:29.760
Don't fight for them; don't be obsessed with them.

389
19:31.350 --> 19:32.310
Hurry, pour the wine.

390
19:32.210 --> 19:38.470
[Peace of Mind]

391
19:33.510 --> 19:34.310
Qingyang,

392
19:35.590 --> 19:37.070
you are so serious all of a sudden,

393
19:37.070 --> 19:38.790
just like those from the Divine Constable Bureau.

394
19:38.790 --> 19:40.110
I don't like it.

395
19:40.440 --> 19:41.240
Let's drink.

396
19:50.550 --> 19:52.160
Speaking of the Divine Constable Bureau,

397
19:52.160 --> 19:53.110
Your Highness,

398
19:53.830 --> 19:56.350
please help me seek justice.

399
19:57.670 --> 20:03.210
[Peace of Mind]

400
19:59.400 --> 20:00.960
Everyone knows that

401
20:01.400 --> 20:03.200
I'm on your side, Your Highness.

402
20:03.960 --> 20:06.350
I solved the case of refining the Spice with young girls.

403
20:06.350 --> 20:07.610
The people of Great Shi

404
20:07.750 --> 20:10.350
are all deeply grateful to you, Your Highness.

405
20:11.070 --> 20:13.440
Even though I did

406
20:13.480 --> 20:15.160
make a tiny mistake,

407
20:15.550 --> 20:18.200
my merits could make up for it.

408
20:18.480 --> 20:19.540
Don't you think so?

409
20:21.270 --> 20:22.350
You are wrong.

410
20:24.400 --> 20:25.240
Am I?

411
20:25.640 --> 20:26.970
Of course you are wrong!

412
20:27.030 --> 20:28.560
I wasn't talking about you.

413
20:29.400 --> 20:31.030
I mean,

414
20:32.200 --> 20:33.400
what did you do wrong?

415
20:36.160 --> 20:37.030
Look at me.

416
20:37.400 --> 20:38.790
Those imperial censors

417
20:38.790 --> 20:40.200
always accuse me

418
20:40.240 --> 20:41.640
of being a spendthrift,

419
20:41.880 --> 20:43.030
living a life of debauchery,

420
20:43.030 --> 20:44.290
without holding back.

421
20:44.400 --> 20:45.750
But little do they know that I, the Crown Prince,

422
20:45.750 --> 20:48.010
represent the imperial family's honor.

423
20:48.240 --> 20:49.310
Even if I

424
20:50.030 --> 20:51.110
spend a little

425
20:51.880 --> 20:53.000
too much

426
20:53.000 --> 20:54.330
or make a small mistake,

427
20:54.400 --> 20:55.160
there's no need

428
20:55.160 --> 20:56.480
to make such a fuss,

429
20:56.480 --> 20:57.310
right?

430
21:00.640 --> 21:01.640
Your Highness,

431
21:02.440 --> 21:03.750
you are also wrong.

432
21:04.680 --> 21:05.480
Am I?

433
21:11.400 --> 21:12.720
Only flowing water

434
21:12.830 --> 21:14.430
is considered living water.

435
21:14.680 --> 21:15.790
And money

436
21:15.790 --> 21:17.550
is just like water.

437
21:17.640 --> 21:19.030
If the future emperor

438
21:19.240 --> 21:21.040
doesn't know how to spend money,

439
21:21.400 --> 21:23.030
how can he make money?

440
21:23.790 --> 21:24.640
Therefore,

441
21:25.030 --> 21:26.400
you did nothing wrong.

442
21:33.550 --> 21:35.200
I just love your sweet talk.

443
21:41.590 --> 21:44.480
[Imperial City, Yuque]

444
21:49.030 --> 21:49.830
Your Majesty,

445
21:50.000 --> 21:52.160
Prince Wenbu of Northern Kun and his envoys

446
21:52.160 --> 21:53.030
are resting 6 miles

447
21:53.030 --> 21:54.070
away from Tianhuang City,

448
21:54.070 --> 21:55.550
waiting for your summons.

449
21:57.400 --> 21:59.270
Just handle it according to the rules.

450
21:59.270 --> 22:00.070
Understood.

451
22:08.270 --> 22:10.870
Your Majesty, the Divine Constable Bureau...

452
22:11.110 --> 22:11.920
Go ahead.

453
22:12.880 --> 22:14.920
The Divine Constable Bureau asked the Ministry of Revenue for more funds,

454
22:14.920 --> 22:16.310
saying that the original Chunsheng Pavilion

455
22:16.310 --> 22:17.200
is no longer big enough,

456
22:17.200 --> 22:18.880
and they need to expand Tianshu Pavilion.

457
22:18.880 --> 22:20.790
Xiazhang Tower also needs renovation.

458
22:20.790 --> 22:22.830
Next year, they will also renovate Qiushou Pavilion

459
22:22.830 --> 22:24.110
and Dongcang Residence.

460
22:24.110 --> 22:26.070
Did the Grand Secretariat say anything?

461
22:26.070 --> 22:27.720
Grand Secretary Bai has already drafted the approval document,

462
22:27.720 --> 22:31.120
just waiting for your approval and signature, Your Majesty.

463
22:31.840 --> 22:35.770
[Emperor Shide of the Shi Empire]

464
22:35.510 --> 22:36.400
Reject it.

465
22:39.510 --> 22:40.570
Yes, Your Majesty.

466
22:44.070 --> 22:44.790
Your Majesty,

467
22:44.790 --> 22:47.050
the Chief Censor submitted 2 memorials.

468
22:49.480 --> 22:50.590
Let her read.

469
22:58.790 --> 23:01.320
One is from the Ministry of Rites, saying that

470
23:01.480 --> 23:03.640
the garden recently renovated by the Crown Prince

471
23:03.640 --> 23:05.240
has 72 door nails,

472
23:05.720 --> 23:07.180
overstepping the limits.

473
23:07.510 --> 23:09.310
The other is from the Ministry of Personnel,

474
23:09.310 --> 23:11.240
dismissing 13 officials,

475
23:11.720 --> 23:13.780
all of whom work for the First Prince.

476
23:23.640 --> 23:26.640
The Ministry of Personnel is in the charge of the Crown Prince,

477
23:26.640 --> 23:28.880
while the Ministry of Rites is overseen by the First Prince.

478
23:28.880 --> 23:30.410
The two sides are fighting.

479
23:31.200 --> 23:32.460
What's your take on it?

480
23:35.240 --> 23:37.830
The Three Secretariats and Six Ministries of the Shi Empire

481
23:37.830 --> 23:39.630
all belong to you, Your Majesty.

482
23:44.110 --> 23:45.920
Oh, Shan...

483
23:48.920 --> 23:50.240
But right now,

484
23:50.640 --> 23:51.720
I

485
23:52.030 --> 23:54.070
do need some "water."

486
23:54.240 --> 23:55.240
I hope you, Young Master Qingyang,

487
23:55.240 --> 23:57.040
will be willing to lend me a hand.

488
23:58.590 --> 24:00.200
Your Highness, I wonder which shop

489
24:00.200 --> 24:02.200
you've taken a fancy to again this time.

490
24:02.200 --> 24:03.920
I will buy the whole street

491
24:03.920 --> 24:05.000
for you.

492
24:05.480 --> 24:07.140
The Divine Constable Bureau.

493
24:14.270 --> 24:16.270
Although I am in charge of the Ministry of Revenue,

494
24:16.270 --> 24:18.880
the funds need documents drafted by the Grand Secretariat,

495
24:18.880 --> 24:20.590
approved and signed by my father, His Majesty.

496
24:20.590 --> 24:22.450
Strange enough, in recent years,

497
24:22.680 --> 24:23.480
the funds

498
24:23.680 --> 24:25.270
for the Divine Constable Bureau

499
24:25.270 --> 24:26.730
have never been approved.

500
24:27.110 --> 24:28.680
I suppose everyone in the Divine Constable Bureau

501
24:28.680 --> 24:29.680
must have quite a few complaints

502
24:29.680 --> 24:31.350
about me, the Crown Prince.

503
24:32.270 --> 24:33.530
Recently, I heard that

504
24:34.160 --> 24:35.160
my eldest brother

505
24:35.680 --> 24:37.030
sent some money

506
24:37.030 --> 24:39.430
to the Divine Constable Bureau in private.

507
24:40.000 --> 24:40.830
He is clearly

508
24:40.830 --> 24:42.590
going against me.

509
24:44.030 --> 24:45.030
Your Highness,

510
24:45.790 --> 24:47.920
you and the First Prince are brothers.

511
24:48.030 --> 24:48.980
Why

512
24:49.270 --> 24:51.310
do you have to keep fighting like this?

513
24:51.310 --> 24:52.110
Brothers?

514
24:52.530 --> 24:53.720
I have no brothers.

515
24:58.920 --> 25:00.030
No brothers.

516
25:03.030 --> 25:04.200
They accepted

517
25:04.200 --> 25:05.270
my eldest brother's money.

518
25:05.270 --> 25:06.200
Do you think

519
25:06.200 --> 25:07.590
they'll accept the money

520
25:07.590 --> 25:08.830
I give them?

521
25:12.720 --> 25:13.640
I heard that

522
25:14.110 --> 25:16.510
the pair of stone lions at the gate of the Divine Constable Bureau

523
25:16.510 --> 25:18.370
haven't been repaired for years.

524
25:23.880 --> 25:25.240
That's why I said

525
25:25.240 --> 25:26.810
everyone in my Eastern Palace

526
25:26.810 --> 25:27.660
put together

527
25:27.720 --> 25:29.030
is still nowhere near as smart as you,

528
25:29.030 --> 25:30.360
Young Master Qingyang.

529
25:31.270 --> 25:32.070
However,

530
25:32.270 --> 25:34.590
sending banknotes is way too conspicuous.

531
25:34.590 --> 25:36.590
How about I send a person over there?

532
25:38.030 --> 25:40.240
Instead of sending money and giving people an excuse to accuse me,

533
25:40.240 --> 25:41.510
it's better to send you, the God of Wealth,

534
25:41.510 --> 25:42.350
over there.

535
25:47.920 --> 25:48.850
I wouldn't dare.

536
25:49.790 --> 25:51.640
What kind of place is the Divine Constable Bureau?

537
25:51.640 --> 25:53.440
How perilous is it to work there?

538
25:54.240 --> 25:55.110
Even if

539
25:55.480 --> 25:57.350
one becomes the Chief of it,

540
25:57.680 --> 25:58.680
it's still

541
25:59.200 --> 26:00.590
not an easy job.

542
26:01.110 --> 26:02.550
Why was the former Chief,

543
26:02.790 --> 26:04.110
Lu Chong, dismissed?

544
26:04.680 --> 26:05.960
Wasn't it because

545
26:06.640 --> 26:08.030
he was incompetent?

546
26:08.030 --> 26:09.270
You know nothing.

547
26:09.310 --> 26:10.240
His Majesty dismissed

548
26:10.240 --> 26:12.370
Lu Chong in order to cover things up...

549
26:15.030 --> 26:16.490
Anyway, just don't worry.

550
26:16.680 --> 26:17.440
The Divine Constable Bureau is

551
26:17.440 --> 26:18.680
ranked above all the Secretariats and Ministries.

552
26:18.680 --> 26:19.240
As long as

553
26:19.240 --> 26:21.370
it doesn't involve imperial affairs,

554
26:21.720 --> 26:23.380
everything will be very safe.

555
26:25.200 --> 26:26.730
So, Your Highness, you mean

556
26:27.440 --> 26:28.790
Lu Chong was dismissed

557
26:28.830 --> 26:30.490
because of imperial affairs?

558
26:32.830 --> 26:33.720
Could it be

559
26:34.510 --> 26:36.200
the incident from 17 years ago...

560
26:36.200 --> 26:36.920
Shut up!

561
26:38.720 --> 26:40.780
Asking about that, do you want to die?

562
26:41.000 --> 26:42.110
I've got nothing to do with that incident.

563
26:42.110 --> 26:43.200
How would I know?

564
26:45.440 --> 26:46.470
Yes, yes.

565
26:47.200 --> 26:48.510
If you don't want to talk about it,

566
26:48.510 --> 26:49.910
I won't bring it up again.

567
26:56.400 --> 26:58.460
This is a toast to you, Your Highness.

568
27:21.200 --> 27:22.060
Your Highness,

569
27:22.070 --> 27:25.070
since you want me to join the Divine Constable Bureau,

570
27:25.440 --> 27:27.350
I am willing to do my best for you.

571
27:28.960 --> 27:29.760
It's just that

572
27:30.510 --> 27:32.430
I am still under arrest now...

573
27:32.430 --> 27:33.750
I've got your back.

574
27:33.920 --> 27:35.520
What's there to be afraid of?

575
27:36.400 --> 27:37.640
From now on,

576
27:38.070 --> 27:40.440
you are not only my cash cow,

577
27:40.680 --> 27:41.680
but also my eyes

578
27:41.680 --> 27:44.000
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

579
27:53.440 --> 27:54.440
Your Highness,

580
27:54.680 --> 27:55.680
it's almost noon.

581
27:55.680 --> 27:56.590
We need to take Li Si

582
27:56.590 --> 27:58.650
back to the Divine Constable Bureau.

583
28:00.930 --> 28:02.290
[Star Room]

584
28:03.440 --> 28:04.240
Pardon us.

585
28:10.030 --> 28:11.000
Your Highness,

586
28:11.240 --> 28:13.030
we are ordered to take Li Qingyang back

587
28:13.030 --> 28:15.760
to the Divine Constable Bureau for questioning.

588
28:17.590 --> 28:18.850
Pardon our intrusion.

589
28:29.880 --> 28:30.740
Your Highness,

590
28:31.310 --> 28:32.200
where is Li Si?

591
28:32.400 --> 28:33.200
How dare you!

592
28:33.880 --> 28:35.000
Are you

593
28:35.680 --> 28:37.640
questioning the Crown Prince?

594
28:39.440 --> 28:40.310
Eunuch Zhao.

595
28:41.590 --> 28:42.720
Are they asking

596
28:42.880 --> 28:44.480
where Li Qingyang is?

597
28:44.480 --> 28:45.590
Yes,

598
28:45.810 --> 28:46.700
Your Highness.

599
28:47.790 --> 28:49.160
But I

600
28:49.240 --> 28:51.200
have never seen Li Qingyang.

601
28:51.510 --> 28:52.720
Neither have I.

602
28:53.270 --> 28:54.440
How baffling!

603
28:54.930 --> 28:57.300
You are wise, Your Highness.

604
28:57.400 --> 28:58.400
So wise!

605
29:08.790 --> 29:10.990
It's not that I don't have money for you.

606
29:11.000 --> 29:12.930
I didn't give you funds on purpose.

607
29:13.440 --> 29:14.720
Do you know why?

608
29:14.920 --> 29:17.440
Waters too clear hold no fish.

609
29:24.880 --> 29:26.360
I deliberately cut

610
29:26.390 --> 29:27.880
your Divine Constable Bureau's funding

611
29:27.880 --> 29:29.110
to make you complain about being poor.

612
29:29.110 --> 29:29.920
Look,

613
29:31.030 --> 29:31.880
hasn't someone

614
29:31.880 --> 29:33.550
rushed to offer timely help?

615
29:34.110 --> 29:35.790
Who are they?

616
29:36.270 --> 29:37.400
The First Prince is one.

617
29:37.400 --> 29:39.680
I think the Crown Prince is also restless.

618
29:39.680 --> 29:41.200
One sent money.

619
29:42.270 --> 29:43.470
What about the other?

620
29:43.680 --> 29:44.610
What did he send?

621
29:47.880 --> 29:50.270
The Crown Prince wanted to send someone

622
29:50.270 --> 29:52.200
into the Divine Constable Bureau.

623
29:52.400 --> 29:53.200
Who?

624
29:54.480 --> 29:56.960
Young Master Qingyang, Li Si.

625
29:58.440 --> 30:01.100
This person is pretty talented at making money.

626
30:01.270 --> 30:02.510
In 3 years since he entered the business,

627
30:02.510 --> 30:03.480
he has opened branches

628
30:03.480 --> 30:05.510
of his Star-Gathering Pavilion all over Great Shi.

629
30:05.510 --> 30:06.440
Rumor has it that

630
30:06.510 --> 30:08.000
this person is a suave gentleman

631
30:08.000 --> 30:09.440
who spends money like water,

632
30:09.440 --> 30:11.070
hits it off with the Crown Prince,

633
30:11.070 --> 30:12.440
and is very close to His Highness.

634
30:12.440 --> 30:13.720
His age and birthplace

635
30:13.830 --> 30:15.110
remain unknown.

636
30:15.590 --> 30:17.650
It was only in the 20th year of Hongyun

637
30:18.480 --> 30:19.640
that the record

638
30:19.680 --> 30:22.140
of his household registration appeared at the border.

639
30:22.140 --> 30:24.680
[Guo Anbang, Head Eunuch]

640
30:29.510 --> 30:31.070
The 20th year of Hongyun?

641
30:32.880 --> 30:33.720
Continue.

642
30:34.790 --> 30:35.590
Moreover,

643
30:36.030 --> 30:38.630
he once broke into Tianshu Pavilion in secret.

644
30:39.030 --> 30:40.480
He was also a suspect in the case of refining the Spice

645
30:40.480 --> 30:41.480
with young girls.

646
30:42.070 --> 30:42.960
A suspect?

647
30:44.030 --> 30:45.290
You didn't arrest him?

648
30:45.510 --> 30:47.040
It was a misunderstanding.

649
30:47.200 --> 30:48.880
Later, Young Master Qingyang, as a commoner,

650
30:48.880 --> 30:51.140
helped our bureau find the real culprit.

651
30:53.070 --> 30:54.750
Do as you see fit.

652
30:55.680 --> 30:56.440
Yes,

653
30:57.070 --> 30:58.160
Your Majesty.

654
31:00.000 --> 31:00.790
Shan.

655
31:03.310 --> 31:04.370
Yes, Your Majesty.

656
31:09.440 --> 31:11.500
Since your elder sister passed away,

657
31:11.830 --> 31:13.160
among my peers,

658
31:13.270 --> 31:15.070
apart from Grand Secretary Bai,

659
31:15.480 --> 31:16.790
you're the only one

660
31:17.790 --> 31:18.960
I can truly talk to.

661
31:20.680 --> 31:22.920
From now on, when there are just the two of us,

662
31:22.920 --> 31:24.520
feel free to speak your mind.

663
31:24.830 --> 31:26.690
Don't be so distant with me, okay?

664
31:30.310 --> 31:31.110
Understood.

665
31:42.640 --> 31:44.440
The 20th year of Hongyun...

666
31:56.120 --> 32:01.280
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

667
32:05.920 --> 32:07.000
Sir,

668
32:07.440 --> 32:09.270
standing before the Shangfang Drum,

669
32:09.270 --> 32:11.750
do you have any grievance to air?

670
32:17.590 --> 32:18.400
Legend has it

671
32:18.880 --> 32:20.070
that in the Shi Empire,

672
32:20.050 --> 32:21.700
[Shangfang Drum]

673
32:20.070 --> 32:21.310
from imperial family

674
32:21.510 --> 32:22.680
to commoners,

675
32:22.110 --> 32:27.150
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

676
32:23.070 --> 32:24.930
no matter what grievance one has,

677
32:25.200 --> 32:27.440
as long as they beat this Shangfang Drum,

678
32:27.440 --> 32:28.790
the Divine Constable Bureau

679
32:28.790 --> 32:31.550
will solve their problems

680
32:31.880 --> 32:33.340
and seek justice for them.

681
32:33.640 --> 32:37.040
Three beats of the drum, and your plea will reach His Majesty.

682
32:37.240 --> 32:38.070
May I ask

683
32:38.680 --> 32:39.880
who you are, lady?

684
32:40.200 --> 32:43.800
And what's your relationship with the Divine Constable Bureau?

685
32:45.830 --> 32:47.720
What brings you

686
32:47.720 --> 32:50.120
to the Divine Constable Bureau, young man?

687
32:54.480 --> 32:55.270
I'd like

688
32:56.400 --> 32:58.460
to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

689
33:04.180 --> 33:06.030
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

690
33:08.160 --> 33:09.090
-Chief. -Chief.

691
33:11.680 --> 33:12.680
Li Qingyang,

692
33:12.830 --> 33:15.000
you recognized me long ago,

693
33:15.880 --> 33:17.920
yet you called me lady.

694
33:18.240 --> 33:19.310
How shameless.

695
33:21.110 --> 33:21.920
So,

696
33:22.590 --> 33:23.680
Chief,

697
33:23.830 --> 33:25.760
you also knew my identity long ago.

698
33:29.010 --> 33:31.350
[Divine Constable Bureau]

699
33:30.440 --> 33:31.640
I am Li Si, a commoner.

700
33:31.640 --> 33:33.680
Greetings, Chief of the Divine Constable Bureau,

701
33:33.680 --> 33:34.920
Lady Xuanyuan.

702
33:37.070 --> 33:38.440
You are a prisoner.

703
33:38.720 --> 33:40.400
Where are your shackles?

704
33:56.950 --> 33:58.080
[Law Prevails]

705
33:58.310 --> 33:59.440
Chief,

706
33:59.510 --> 34:00.960
I have long heard that the Divine Constable Bureau

707
34:00.960 --> 34:02.200
safeguards the peace and security

708
34:02.200 --> 34:03.510
of Great Shi

709
34:03.680 --> 34:04.960
as the pillar of the state.

710
34:04.960 --> 34:05.880
Thanks to

711
34:06.110 --> 34:07.830
the instructions of Constable Ghost

712
34:07.830 --> 34:08.960
and Constable Frost

713
34:09.000 --> 34:10.440
along the way,

714
34:10.920 --> 34:13.630
I admire the Divine Constable Bureau deeply.

715
34:13.760 --> 34:15.710
I wish to join the Divine Constable Bureau

716
34:15.710 --> 34:16.880
to serve the state.

717
34:17.150 --> 34:19.800
I hope you will grant my wish, Chief.

718
34:21.480 --> 34:23.920
Since the establishment of the Divine Constable Bureau,

719
34:23.920 --> 34:26.550
the selection criteria have been extremely harsh.

720
34:26.550 --> 34:28.280
Not only must they be absolutely loyal,

721
34:28.280 --> 34:29.800
with both brains and brawn,

722
34:29.800 --> 34:31.190
but more importantly,

723
34:31.510 --> 34:33.360
they must have clean backgrounds.

724
34:33.360 --> 34:34.670
This condition alone

725
34:34.670 --> 34:37.530
can leave you unqualified, Young Master Qingyang.

726
34:37.960 --> 34:39.190
What makes you think

727
34:39.400 --> 34:41.730
you can join the Divine Constable Bureau?

728
34:48.960 --> 34:50.190
Back in Dougu County,

729
34:50.710 --> 34:52.150
I joined hands with the two constables

730
34:52.150 --> 34:54.000
to solve the Moluo Flower Case,

731
34:54.190 --> 34:55.510
which could be considered

732
34:55.510 --> 34:57.280
protecting the local people.

733
34:57.320 --> 34:58.150
This is

734
35:00.150 --> 35:02.000
somewhat a merit I've earned for myself, right?

735
35:02.000 --> 35:03.440
As a commoner, you

736
35:03.800 --> 35:07.150
interfered in the case managed by our Divine Constable Bureau

737
35:07.150 --> 35:09.510
and secretly broke into Tianshu Pavilion.

738
35:09.510 --> 35:11.150
Were it not for your little merit

739
35:11.150 --> 35:12.590
of helping solve the case,

740
35:12.590 --> 35:14.800
you would be in prison right now.

741
35:15.920 --> 35:18.120
With your merit offsetting your fault,

742
35:18.760 --> 35:20.000
let's consider the score

743
35:20.000 --> 35:21.320
settled.

744
35:30.960 --> 35:31.760
You may get up.

745
35:35.110 --> 35:36.320
Thank you, Chief.

746
35:40.880 --> 35:43.080
Since your merit has offset your fault,

747
35:43.320 --> 35:46.520
on what grounds can you join the Divine Constable Bureau?

748
35:55.590 --> 35:57.590
I am the Crown Prince's good friend.

749
35:57.800 --> 35:58.920
As far as I know,

750
35:59.960 --> 36:00.710
Chief,

751
36:00.710 --> 36:03.150
you are the younger sister of the late Empress,

752
36:03.150 --> 36:05.960
which makes you the Crown Prince's aunt.

753
36:06.960 --> 36:08.590
Considering this relationship...

754
36:08.590 --> 36:10.920
The Divine Constable Bureau is independent of the imperial court,

755
36:10.920 --> 36:12.920
never influenced by personal ties.

756
36:15.000 --> 36:17.760
You are just a friend of the Crown Prince.

757
36:18.320 --> 36:19.710
Even the Crown Prince himself

758
36:19.710 --> 36:21.400
would have to pass our assessment

759
36:21.400 --> 36:23.460
to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

760
36:23.490 --> 36:24.520
I believe

761
36:25.150 --> 36:26.550
there's no door in the world

762
36:26.550 --> 36:28.010
that can't be pushed open.

763
36:28.110 --> 36:29.480
It just depends on whether you're willing

764
36:29.480 --> 36:30.670
and brave enough to push.

765
36:30.670 --> 36:32.230
Whatever the trial,

766
36:32.280 --> 36:34.440
I am willing to take it on.

767
36:38.880 --> 36:39.670
Actually,

768
36:40.070 --> 36:42.070
a year's salary at the Divine Constable Bureau

769
36:42.070 --> 36:43.230
can't even cover your expenses

770
36:43.230 --> 36:45.290
in one night, Young Master Qingyang.

771
36:45.590 --> 36:47.440
Why do you want to join

772
36:49.070 --> 36:50.730
the Divine Constable Bureau?

773
37:01.710 --> 37:02.910
To be honest with you,

774
37:02.960 --> 37:04.280
besides

775
37:04.510 --> 37:05.710
making money

776
37:05.760 --> 37:07.110
and doing business,

777
37:07.480 --> 37:10.000
my biggest hobby is

778
37:12.670 --> 37:13.930
investigating cases.

779
37:15.320 --> 37:17.230
If I hear of an unsolved case,

780
37:17.230 --> 37:18.000
I just

781
37:19.490 --> 37:21.590
can't sleep well or eat well

782
37:21.670 --> 37:23.440
before I find the real culprit.

783
37:24.020 --> 37:24.830
Therefore,

784
37:25.150 --> 37:27.070
if I can join the Divine Constable Bureau,

785
37:27.070 --> 37:28.960
which symbolizes the authority of the law,

786
37:28.960 --> 37:30.320
be a constable,

787
37:30.510 --> 37:31.960
solve cases, and catch culprits,

788
37:31.960 --> 37:35.070
then I would have no regrets in this life.

789
37:40.960 --> 37:42.880
Constable Ghost, Constable Frost,

790
37:42.880 --> 37:43.880
what do you think?

791
37:44.480 --> 37:45.280
Chief,

792
37:46.320 --> 37:47.190
Li Qingyang

793
37:47.190 --> 37:49.070
is indeed capable.

794
37:49.590 --> 37:50.880
But I think

795
37:50.880 --> 37:53.070
he is used to being an undisciplined, free spirit.

796
37:53.070 --> 37:53.920
I'm afraid he can't stand

797
37:53.920 --> 37:56.980
the Divine Constable Bureau's rules and regulations.

798
37:57.000 --> 37:57.960
When solving cases,

799
37:57.960 --> 37:59.690
he has his own unique insights.

800
38:00.070 --> 38:01.880
But to join the Divine Constable Bureau,

801
38:01.880 --> 38:03.410
an assessment is required.

802
38:04.760 --> 38:05.690
Do you hear that?

803
38:06.000 --> 38:07.320
They want to test you.

804
38:07.710 --> 38:09.000
I agree.

805
38:09.880 --> 38:12.410
Whoever wants to test him, set the questions.

806
38:13.960 --> 38:15.960
Please bring it on, My Lord, My Lady.

807
38:16.760 --> 38:17.590
Li Qingyang,

808
38:18.190 --> 38:20.280
the Northern Kun delegation is about to enter the capital.

809
38:20.280 --> 38:21.550
We cannot let the scoundrels

810
38:21.550 --> 38:22.510
in Tianhuang City

811
38:22.510 --> 38:24.280
ruin the imperial court's dignity.

812
38:24.280 --> 38:26.880
The Divine Constable Bureau has imposed martial law across the city lately.

813
38:26.880 --> 38:28.960
You can make your contribution.

814
38:31.670 --> 38:33.320
Lady Constable Frost, do you

815
38:34.150 --> 38:35.960
want me to catch a few criminals?

816
38:36.320 --> 38:37.320
Don't send over

817
38:37.320 --> 38:38.550
any petty criminals.

818
38:38.550 --> 38:41.610
It'll be beneath your status as Young Master Qingyang.

819
38:43.150 --> 38:45.550
Then please enlighten me. What kind of criminal

820
38:45.550 --> 38:47.320
is not considered a petty one?

821
38:48.150 --> 38:52.010
Young Master Qingyang, have you ever heard of the Underworld Market?

822
38:53.960 --> 38:54.960
Constable Ghost,

823
38:55.280 --> 38:57.480
tell Li Si about the Underworld Market.

824
38:57.840 --> 38:58.630
Yes, Chief.

825
39:00.590 --> 39:02.480
The Underworld Market in the suburbs of Tianhuang City

826
39:02.480 --> 39:03.550
is the largest black market,

827
39:03.550 --> 39:05.280
also known as the Ghost Market.

828
39:05.360 --> 39:07.320
The vendors inside act outside the law,

829
39:07.320 --> 39:08.800
selling banned drugs

830
39:08.800 --> 39:10.000
and rare items.

831
39:10.000 --> 39:11.590
The Divine Constable Bureau intends to purge them,

832
39:11.590 --> 39:13.550
but those vendors are elusive

833
39:13.590 --> 39:14.920
and extremely cunning.

834
39:14.920 --> 39:17.450
I have searched for years, yet found no clues.

835
39:17.550 --> 39:19.030
Lord Constable Ghost has searched for years

836
39:19.030 --> 39:20.560
without finding any clues.

837
39:21.070 --> 39:22.150
And, Chief,

838
39:23.190 --> 39:24.720
you want me to investigate?

839
39:26.550 --> 39:28.280
This is such a hard nut to crack.

840
39:28.360 --> 39:30.550
Chief, I think you just

841
39:31.550 --> 39:33.880
don't want me to join the Divine Constable Bureau.

842
39:33.880 --> 39:35.800
I didn't ask you to catch them all.

843
39:36.550 --> 39:37.800
Catching a contact

844
39:37.800 --> 39:39.960
or finding some contraband goods from the Ghost Market

845
39:39.960 --> 39:41.420
will be considered a pass.

846
39:46.630 --> 39:47.360
Young Landlord,

847
39:47.360 --> 39:48.880
is it really just a fine?

848
39:48.880 --> 39:49.920
No going to jail?

849
39:49.920 --> 39:50.510
It's not easy to fool

850
39:50.510 --> 39:52.170
the Divine Constable Bureau.

851
39:52.710 --> 39:54.170
This is way too difficult.

852
39:55.440 --> 39:56.920
Lord Constable Ghost has searched for years

853
39:56.920 --> 39:58.450
and hasn't found anything.

854
39:58.670 --> 39:59.510
I think...

855
40:01.280 --> 40:03.150
I'll probably fail this time.

856
40:03.230 --> 40:04.630
Yes, they're not easy to fool.

857
40:04.630 --> 40:05.440
However...

858
40:08.030 --> 40:09.030
I will still

859
40:09.880 --> 40:11.400
try my best

860
40:11.440 --> 40:13.150
to live up to your expectations.

861
40:13.150 --> 40:14.760
The things you sell

862
40:15.150 --> 40:16.150
can't kill

863
40:16.150 --> 40:17.110
or harm anyone.

864
40:17.480 --> 40:18.540
I'll take my leave.

865
40:19.400 --> 40:20.230
Don't worry!

866
40:20.480 --> 40:21.510
When you're caught,

867
40:21.510 --> 40:22.710
I will cover

868
40:22.710 --> 40:24.150
all the fines.

869
40:26.280 --> 40:27.440
Anyone willing

870
40:27.440 --> 40:28.870
to play along with me

871
40:29.110 --> 40:31.510
will have one year's rent waived.

872
40:31.510 --> 40:32.400
I'm willing to do it!

873
40:32.400 --> 40:33.360
-I'll do it! -I'll go!

874
40:33.360 --> 40:34.800
Ten people at most.

875
40:34.960 --> 40:36.590
Too many would look fake.

876
40:37.160 --> 40:40.380
[Divine Constable Bureau]

877
40:39.880 --> 40:40.680
How splendid!

878
40:40.960 --> 40:42.710
Oh my goodness, look at this.

879
40:42.710 --> 40:43.710
Is it made of gold?

880
40:43.710 --> 40:45.150
I really wish I could touch it.

881
40:45.150 --> 40:47.810
It's so grand. I've never seen anything like it.

882
40:48.320 --> 40:49.150
Silence!

883
40:52.150 --> 40:53.710
You! What are you doing?

884
40:54.110 --> 40:55.150
Don't make any noise.

885
40:55.150 --> 40:56.680
Everyone, kneel properly.

886
41:00.550 --> 41:01.710
You, kneel down.

887
41:02.150 --> 41:03.590
I'm already on my knees.

888
41:05.590 --> 41:06.710
You're still this tall on your knees?

889
41:06.710 --> 41:07.630
You should see me

890
41:07.630 --> 41:08.920
when I'm standing.

891
41:09.150 --> 41:10.190
Then stand up.

892
41:18.550 --> 41:19.710
Kneel down!

893
41:19.880 --> 41:20.670
Kneel!

894
41:22.150 --> 41:22.960
It's me.

895
41:23.150 --> 41:25.080
Stop blabbering. Kneel properly.

896
41:25.670 --> 41:26.600
Kneel properly.

897
41:29.510 --> 41:30.590
Behave yourselves

898
41:30.760 --> 41:32.420
and listen to the constables.

899
41:33.150 --> 41:34.320
Come clean!

900
41:34.710 --> 41:35.800
Everyone must sign a guarantee

901
41:35.800 --> 41:36.730
before leaving!

902
41:39.710 --> 41:40.590
Chief,

903
41:41.110 --> 41:43.110
although these culprits have violated the law,

904
41:43.110 --> 41:44.840
their offenses are very minor.

905
41:45.550 --> 41:47.150
Let's detain them for 3 days,

906
41:47.670 --> 41:49.070
have them pay a ransom of 20 taels of silver

907
41:49.070 --> 41:50.030
as a guarantee,

908
41:50.710 --> 41:53.360
and then release them, pending summons. How's that?

909
41:53.360 --> 41:55.110
Just detain... Just detain us for 3 days.

910
41:55.110 --> 41:56.150
I heard that.

911
41:56.150 --> 41:56.510
Silence!

912
41:56.510 --> 41:57.710
I heard it.

913
42:02.960 --> 42:03.710
Yes, Chief.

914
42:04.550 --> 42:05.360
Go.

915
42:05.760 --> 42:06.550
Go!

916
42:06.550 --> 42:07.280
Go!

917
42:07.320 --> 42:09.000
-Go! -Be gentle! I can walk myself!

918
42:09.000 --> 42:09.840
Three days?

919
42:10.070 --> 42:10.880
Three days.

920
42:12.030 --> 42:12.840
Go.

921
42:19.480 --> 42:20.510
Chief.

922
42:22.760 --> 42:23.550
I wonder

923
42:24.320 --> 42:25.710
if I caught enough

924
42:25.920 --> 42:26.960
of them.

925
42:27.710 --> 42:29.280
If you're not satisfied,

926
42:29.710 --> 42:31.040
I can go catch some more.

927
42:36.320 --> 42:37.710
I deliberately cut

928
42:37.710 --> 42:39.510
your Divine Constable Bureau's funding

929
42:39.510 --> 42:41.640
to make you complain about being poor.

930
42:41.880 --> 42:42.670
Look,

931
42:43.760 --> 42:44.960
hasn't someone rushed

932
42:44.960 --> 42:46.320
to offer timely help?

933
42:47.000 --> 42:48.400
I also want to see

934
42:49.070 --> 42:50.710
who in the imperial court

935
42:50.880 --> 42:53.540
wants to win over your Divine Constable Bureau.

936
42:53.550 --> 42:55.920
If the Divine Constable Bureau wants to grasp and see into

937
42:55.920 --> 42:58.150
the trends of various forces in the imperial court,

938
42:58.150 --> 42:58.960
we must open a door

939
42:58.960 --> 43:00.360
exceptionally for those

940
43:00.360 --> 43:02.280
with ulterior motives.

941
43:04.920 --> 43:06.960
Since you want to join the Divine Constable Bureau,

942
43:06.960 --> 43:08.150
let me see

943
43:08.360 --> 43:10.620
what kind of person you are, Li Qingyang.

944
43:19.800 --> 43:21.550
I hereby admit Li Si

945
43:21.710 --> 43:23.710
into the Divine Constable Bureau

946
43:23.760 --> 43:25.480
as a Trainee Constable.

947
43:25.590 --> 43:26.630
Chief!

948
43:26.760 --> 43:28.490
No further discussion on this.

949
43:28.960 --> 43:29.960
Constable Eagle,

950
43:31.070 --> 43:32.150
take Constable Li

951
43:32.150 --> 43:33.880
to get familiar with the environment.

952
43:33.880 --> 43:36.110
Tell him all the rules and regulations

953
43:36.110 --> 43:37.800
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

954
43:37.800 --> 43:38.590
Yes, Chief.

955
43:43.320 --> 43:45.550
Since you've joined our Divine Constable Bureau,

956
43:45.550 --> 43:47.590
you must uphold justice and abide by the law.

957
43:47.590 --> 43:49.000
If you break the rules,

958
43:49.320 --> 43:51.520
there are regulations for punishment.

959
43:52.480 --> 43:53.280
Understood.

960
43:54.150 --> 43:55.230
I'll follow your instructions, Chief.
